#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Not all options work together on all types of circuits. See the [feature compatibility table](/guides/sampler-options#options-compatibility-table) guide for full details.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Ne všechny možnosti fungují dohromady se všemi typy obvodů. Úplné podrobnosti najdeš v průvodci [tabulkou kompatibility funkcí](/guides/sampler-options#options-compatibility-table).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

